WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.734 --> 00:00:02.834
-By day, she is
a camp activities leader

00:00:02.834 --> 00:00:04.934
from Myrtle Beach,
South Carolina.

00:00:04.934 --> 00:00:08.367
But by night, she's
a Dolly Parton tribute artist

00:00:08.367 --> 00:00:10.834
and winner of
"Clash of the Cover Bands."

00:00:10.834 --> 00:00:13.934
Here to perform a medley
of Dolly Parton hits,

00:00:13.934 --> 00:00:16.033
Karen Hester!

00:00:16.033 --> 00:00:20.100
[ Cheers and applause ]

00:00:20.100 --> 00:00:23.367
-Well, hello, everybody!

00:00:23.367 --> 00:00:28.400
Woo-hoo!

00:00:28.400 --> 00:00:30.901
♪ I tumble outta bed
and I stumble to the kitchen ♪

00:00:30.901 --> 00:00:33.033
♪ Pour myself
a cup of ambition ♪

00:00:33.033 --> 00:00:37.367
♪ Yawnin' and stretchin'
and try to come to life ♪

00:00:37.367 --> 00:00:39.934
♪ I jump in the shower
and the blood starts pumpin' ♪

00:00:39.934 --> 00:00:42.200
♪ Out on the streets,
the traffic starts jumpin' ♪

00:00:42.200 --> 00:00:46.334
♪ With folks like me on the job
from 9 to 5, yeah ♪

00:00:46.334 --> 00:00:51.000
♪ Working 9 to 5,
what a way to make a living ♪

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:55.367
♪ Barely gettin' by, it's all
taking and no giving ♪

00:00:55.367 --> 00:00:59.934
♪ They just use your mind and
they never give you credit ♪

00:00:59.934 --> 00:01:05.000
♪ It's enough to drive you
crazy if you let it ♪

00:01:05.000 --> 00:01:09.100
♪ 9 to 5, well, they got you
where they want you ♪

00:01:09.100 --> 00:01:11.300
♪ There's a better life ♪

00:01:11.300 --> 00:01:13.501
♪ Y'all dream about it,
don't you? ♪

00:01:13.501 --> 00:01:15.701
♪ It's a rich man's game ♪

00:01:15.701 --> 00:01:18.067
♪ I don't care
what they call it ♪

00:01:18.067 --> 00:01:23.167
♪ And you spend your life
putting money in his wallet ♪

00:01:23.167 --> 00:01:25.834
♪ 9 to 5 ♪

00:01:25.834 --> 00:01:30.167
[ "Jolene" plays ]

00:01:30.167 --> 00:01:35.567
♪ Jolene, Jolene,
Jolene, Jolene ♪

00:01:35.567 --> 00:01:41.901
♪ I'm begging of you,
please don't take my man ♪

00:01:41.901 --> 00:01:47.434
♪ Jolene, Jolene,
Jolene, Jolene ♪

00:01:47.434 --> 00:01:53.234
♪ Please don't take him
just because you can ♪

00:01:53.234 --> 00:01:59.767
♪ Jolennnne ♪

00:01:59.767 --> 00:02:03.067
Woo! Let's party!

00:02:03.067 --> 00:02:07.300
♪ Two doors down, they're
laughing and having a party ♪

00:02:07.300 --> 00:02:11.434
♪ Yeah, two doors down they're
not aware that I'm around ♪

00:02:11.434 --> 00:02:16.033
♪ But here I am just crying my
heart out, feeling sorry ♪

00:02:16.033 --> 00:02:20.033
♪ But they're having a party
just two doors down ♪

00:02:20.033 --> 00:02:21.133
Let's party!

00:02:21.133 --> 00:02:25.200
♪ Oh-oh-oh, whoa,
two doors down ♪

00:02:25.200 --> 00:02:28.601
♪ Whoa-ho-ho, two doors ♪

00:02:28.601 --> 00:02:34.667
♪ Dooooowwwnnn ♪

00:02:34.667 --> 00:02:37.167
Woo-hoo!

00:02:37.167 --> 00:02:39.000
-Oh, my goodness!

00:02:39.000 --> 00:02:41.434
That was how you do it,
right there!

00:02:41.434 --> 00:02:43.167
Thank you so much!

00:02:43.167 --> 00:02:44.901
-Thank you so much, Jimmy!

00:02:44.901 --> 00:02:46.534
-Karen Hester, right there!

00:02:46.534 --> 00:02:48.868
-And happy birthday
to Dolly Parton!

00:02:48.868 --> 00:02:50.133
-Happy birthday to Dolly.

